4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B697mFz1yMoQ7kNvwFRlJ91&_nc_oc=AdpiBS1Y-dHLg4fRFVQIDJZ9-bXWEx5caU34XTyeFEN8feGWNYKK-m5rdeiv06_bpyE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDMk0UpJbkbH8hJVz54pjqalrrKizBT8mo3aUBxigRowA&oe=6A54E254"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YGUJAwiId0MQ7kNvwGzOCPz&_nc_oc=AdqksYKkaF2p5NmUdAY0dHznU2x5q--Ez1tzwPZGoKf_KdCc61gQzdGhTMOr5eVFHl0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBs8TaMdUKylFSpzstFyQGjwyAkwyvwxPB2g91zSVXDng&oe=6A54E732"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KhckJ6dn5mwQ7kNvwHW-KrJ&_nc_oc=Adosjoe69uOOn_axE14fgxeamWp8KQsNBphQvo-87XF1oSMNYmBd2rzb61aqM_SMvAI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCmKutK4KTaYjWfYwZonrKBQ0WTuDVIktLB61U4XmsZCw&oe=6A54F4D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p